    <sec id="sec_scope">
      <label>1</label>
      <title>Scope</title>
      <p>This Recommendation applies to clinical thermometers, mercury-in-glass,
        with maximum device.</p>
    </sec>
    <sec id="sec_field_of_application">
      <label>2</label>
      <title>Field of application</title>
      <p>This Recommendation applies to all clinical thermometers of the
        maximum device type placed on the market in OIML Member States.</p>
